<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
Engineering-only OuttaMyWay DIAGNOSTIC publication switch.

Copy this file to:
  <Farming Simulator user profile>/modSettings/<modName>/diagnostics.xml

For a normal installation <modName> is usually FS25_OuttaMyWay.

enabled="true"  -> DIAGNOSTIC log publication enabled on next mod/game load.
enabled="false" -> DIAGNOSTIC log publication disabled.
Deleting the sidecar also disables DIAGNOSTIC publication.

Optional engineering-only spatialFarmlandId="2" targets the registered field
inside Farmland 2 for a one-shot spatial survey. Omit this attribute to
retain the original Field 77 fixture. If more than one field belongs to
the selected farmland, the survey reports ambiguity and does not guess.
Farmland IDs are not necessarily registered field IDs.

This file is not supported player Configuration and is never created automatically.
-->
<outtaMyWayDiagnostics enabled="true" spatialFarmlandId="2" />
